ets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress with Your Katana:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your katana to fight enemies and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.poster.avif?t=1761424836\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.webm?t=1761424836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.mp4?t=1761424836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Be a raccoon master.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377570?t=1761424836","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/486ce98715615c0b6e3e803a92fb46091e647ce1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761424836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/518d7d05eb07404934e7d5297edb9201eb0778d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761424836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/518d7d05eb07404934e7d5297edb9201eb0778d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761424836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available",